# 行尾统一：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows/CI 混签出造成 pi 资源哈希漂移
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制一律不做转换
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.so binary
*.onnx binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.apk binary
*.ttf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
# agent 运行时与模型（大文件，内容敏感）
m9a-agent-dist/** binary
pi/resource/base/model/** binary
